<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the default script for handling events. This is the script that will be fire for all event types, specifically for engine level events. It should be noted that this can also be called on Player Characters - though to get players firing events properly, the specified events must first be enabled using EnablevEvent().
</p><p><br />
</p>
